ange the conversation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource management and supply store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pet and interact with the creatures (some of them don't like to be petted, but you can try)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alive NPCs with dreams who can pretty much die anytime, better watch out for that</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">World navigation by use of coordinates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mystery waiting to be solved</p></li></ul>",
